Package: flightlens
Title: Explore Historical Departure Delays from New York City
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Vishal", "Sampath", email = "vsam0014@student.monash.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides prepared New York City flight records from 2013,
    reusable route filtering and departure-delay summaries, and a Shiny
    application. Supports historical airline and departure-period
    comparisons with explicit measurement denominators, missing-data
    counts, and sample-size cautions.
